                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>For the record of a conversation held January 29, and developments subsequent
                    thereto, relating to an alleged approach to the United States from the People’s
                    Republic of China concerning a proposed accommodation in Korea, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1951v07p2/pg_1530">pages 1530</ref> ff.</p>
